# The JDK this repository builds and releases with (astrapi69/file-worker#97); `sdk env` sets the shell to it. The workflows set up
# exactly this build and check that they did: javac's --release keeps the class files independent of the patch
# level, but the javadoc tool is not, so a release is rebuilt bit for bit only on the same JDK. A later patch
# release is taken on deliberately, in a pull request of its own, here and in the java-version of the workflows.
java=25.0.5.0+8-tem
